<title>POLAND: POLAND OFFERS PLN 600 MLN 10-YR BONDS JULY 9.</title>
<headline>POLAND OFFERS PLN 600 MLN 10-YR BONDS JULY 9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry</p>
<p>offered to sell 600 million zlotys of 10-year floating bonds on</p>
<p>July 9, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The value date for the tender is July 17, 1997 and the</p>
<p>bonds mature on July 18, 2007.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
